   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "## Experiment 1: geometry_KCD vs semantic_KCD — Hard Stress Set\n",
    "\n",
    "Policies: `uniform`, `semantic`, `geometry`, `geometry_keep_compress_drop`, `semantic_keep_compress_drop`\n",
    "\n",
    "Benchmark: hard stress set (`long_dependency`, `retrieval_heavy`, `code_conversation`)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "cell-6",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "%cd {REPO_DIR}\n",
    "!bash scripts/run_paper3_signal_comparison_hardset.sh \"{EXP1_NAME}\" \"{MODEL}\" \"{BUDGETS}\""
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "cell-7",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# ── Read Experiment 1 results ────────────────────────────────────────────────\n",
    "%cd {REPO_DIR}\n",
    "pairwise_path = f\"results/paper3/studies/{EXP1_NAME}/pairwise_report.md\"\n",
    "if os.path.exists(pairwise_path):\n",
    "    with open(pairwise_path) as f:\n",
    "        print(f.read())\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    print(\"Pairwise report not found — check run output above for errors.\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "cell-8",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# ── Memory critical analysis — geometry_KCD vs semantic_KCD at budget 0.35 ───\n",
    "import glob\n",
    "for pattern in [f\"results/paper3/studies/{EXP1_NAME}/memory_critical_*_geometry_kcd_b035.md\",\n",
    "                f\"results/paper3/studies/{EXP1_NAME}/memory_critical_*_semantic_kcd_b035.md\"]:\n",
    "    for path in sorted(glob.glob(pattern)):\n",
    "        print(f\"\\n{'='*60}\\n{path}\\n{'='*60}\")\n",
    "        with open(path) as f:\n",
    "            print(f.read())"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "cell-9",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "## Experiment 2: Gate 1 — Geometry Refinement Inside a Semantic Shortlist\n",
    "\n",
    "Runs oracle headroom probe + policy refinement study on:\n",
    "- `MSC valid` (persona / preference continuity)\n",
    "- `LongMemEval-S cleaned` (episodic retrieval)\n",
    "\n",
    "Policies: `semantic`, `budget_aware_semantic_KCD`, `semantic_ambient_geometry_KCD`, `semantic_query_conditioned_geometry_KCD`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "cell-10",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "%cd {REPO_DIR}\n",
